, </span><span begin="00:54.410" end="00:54.560">it's </span><span begin="00:54.560" end="00:54.800">no </span><span begin="00:54.800" end="00:55.250">thing</span><span begin="00:55.250" end="00:55.250">, </span><span begin="00:55.250" end="00:55.670">maybe </span><span begin="00:55.670" end="00:55.820">it </span><span begin="00:55.820" end="00:56.240">slipped</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.300" end="00:59.360"><span begin="00:56.300" end="00:56.510">but </span><span begin="00:56.510" end="00:56.630">the </span><span begin="00:56.630" end="00:57.020">slip </span><span begin="00:57.020" end="00:57.470">turns </span><span begin="00:57.470" end="00:57.590">to </span><span begin="00:57.590" end="00:58.130">terror </span><span begin="00:58.130" end="00:58.310">and </span><span begin="00:58.310" end="00:58.400">a </span><span begin="00:58.400" end="00:58.850">crush </span><span begin="00:58.850" end="00:59.000">to </span><span begin="00:59.000" end="00:59.360">like</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.360" end="01:02.600"><span begin="00:59.360" end="00:59.600">when </span><span begin="00:59.600" end="00:59.810">she </span><span begin="00:59.810" end="01:00.350">walked </span><span begin="01:00.350" end="01:00.620">in </span><span begin="01:00.620" end="01:00.770">he </span><span begin="01:00.770" end="01:01.280">froze </span><span begin="01:01.280" end="01:01.490">up</span><span begin="01:01.490" end="01:01.490">, </span><span begin="01:01.490" end="01:01.850">leave </span><span begin="01:01.850" end="01:01.970">it </span><span begin="01:01.970" end="01:02.150">to </span><span begin="01:02.150" end="01:02.600">fright</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.780" end="01:05.630"><span begin="01:02.780" end="01:02.990">It's </span><span begin="01:02.990" end="01:03.410">cute </span><span begin="01:03.410" end="01:03.800">in </span><span begin="01:03.800" end="01:03.920">a </span><span begin="01:03.920" end="01:04.280">way</span><span begin="01:04.280" end="01